// The cloud model's address. Empty means there is no cloud model: the
// setting stays off and can't be turned on, and no network code runs.
// It must be an https address. xcconfig reads // as a comment, so write
// the slashes as https:/$()/example.com when you set it.
// Never put keys or tokens here. Sign-in goes through CloudAuth.
PEBBLE_CLOUD_ENDPOINT =
